---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---

<AppLayout title="Battery Storage (BESS) | OnLoop Energy" description="OnLoop Energy does not currently offer standalone Battery Energy Storage Systems (BESS). Our focus is exclusively on Small Wind Turbines and Hybrid (Wind + Solar) systems for Commercial & Industrial facilities.">
<div>

  {/* Hero Section */}
  <section class="hero hero--short">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__content">
        <div class="hero__badge" style="margin-top: var(--space-12);">
          <span class="hero__badge-dot"></span>
          A Straightforward Answer
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero__title">
          We don't offer<br />
          <span class="hero__title-highlight">standalone BESS.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__subtitle">OnLoop Energy is focused exclusively on Small Wind Turbines and Hybrid (Wind + Solar) energy systems for Commercial & Industrial facilities. Battery Energy Storage is not currently within our scope.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Explanation Section */}
  <section class="content-section fade-in">
    <div class="container container--narrow" style="text-align: center;">
      <h2 class="content-section__title" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">Why we focus on generation, not storage</h2>
      <p class="content-section__text">Battery storage is a valuable tool — but it is most effective when paired with the right generation foundation. Our expertise is in engineering that foundation: site-specific small wind turbines and hybrid wind + solar systems that deliver 24/7 clean generation for C&I facilities.</p>
      <p class="content-section__text" style="margin-top: var(--space-4);">When a facility has reliable wind and solar generation, the need for battery storage often diminishes substantially. Wind generates at night and during monsoon. Hybrid systems extend coverage across the full diurnal cycle. The right generation architecture reduces grid dependence without adding the cost and complexity of large-scale battery banks.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* What We Do Offer */}
  <section class="content-section content-section--light fade-in">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-section__header">
        <span class="content-section__label">What We Do Offer</span>
        <h2 class="content-section__title">Our C&I Energy Solutions</h2>
        <p class="content-section__text">If you are looking to reduce energy costs, eliminate grid dependence, or improve energy resilience at your C&I facility, these are the solutions we can help you with.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card__icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M9.59 4.59A2 2 0 1 1 11 8H2m10.59 11.41A2 2 0 1 0 14 16H2m15.73-8.27A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 19.5 12H2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="card__title">Small Wind Turbine Systems</h4>
          <p class="card__text">Site-specific small wind turbines for C&I facilities — deployed only where wind resource data genuinely supports long-term performance. Generates power 24/7, including evenings, nights, and monsoon season.</p>
          <a href="/wind" class="btn btn--primary" style="margin-top: var(--space-4); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2);">
            Learn About Wind
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="16" height="16">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
              <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card__icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z" />
              <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5" />
              <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="card__title">Hybrid Energy Systems (Wind + Solar)</h4>
          <p class="card__text">A single coordinated architecture combining daytime solar with wind generation across the full diurnal and seasonal cycle. Higher CUF, better land utilization, and true 24/7 coverage — without battery storage.</p>
          <a href="/hybrid" class="btn btn--primary" style="margin-top: var(--space-4); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2);">
            Learn About Hybrid
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="16" height="16">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
              <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* CTA */}
  <section class="cta-section fade-in">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-section__content">
        <h2 class="cta-section__title">Not sure which solution fits your site?</h2>
        <p class="cta-section__text">Talk to our team. We will run an honest feasibility assessment of your site's wind resource and load profile — and tell you what the data actually supports.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--large">
          Talk to Our Team
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
</AppLayout>
